# cms-shop backend

Shopify Embedded App (Django + Wagtail) — CMS headless: una instalación = una
tienda Shopify (**deploy-per-shop**); desplegable en cualquier shop. No hay
campo `shop` en páginas Wagtail ni Site-per-shop. Tenancy + `ShopMembership` en
`shopify_config` — ver `docs/adr/0002-shop-tenancy-membership.md`.

## Stack y apps

| App | Rol |
|-----|-----|
| `shopify_admin` | UI embebida, OAuth App Home (`/shopify-admin/`) |
| `shopify_config` | ShopConfig + tokens + tenancy/membership (`db_table=core_shopconfig`) |
| `core` | Solo plataforma Django (`ensure_superuser`) |
| `shopify_content` | Páginas Wagtail sincronizadas a Shopify |
| `shopify_requests` | Cliente GraphQL centralizado |
| `metaobjects` | Toolkit metaobjetos Shopify |
| `api` | API django-ninja para agentes AI |
| `webhooks` | Receptores webhooks Shopify |

## Comandos habituales

```bash
make test                              # pytest
.venv/bin/python manage.py migrate
```

Management commands aceptan `--shop` (fallback `SHOPIFY_PUBLICATION_SHOP` o
sole `ShopConfig`).

